Subject: [PATCH 097/230] Polish Profile and TeamPage: favorite teams shelf,
 fixture scorelines, grouped season stats
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Profile reached favorites only through the onboarding picker's edit link;
a crest shelf in the Account section shows what is actually followed and gets
back to a club page in one tap. The club page's fixtures were a text line, so
they now read as crest-to-crest scorelines with the current club in volt, and
the flat season list is split into Attack and Defense & control cards so the
numbers are grouped by what they mean instead of stacked. The old flat list's
W/D/L record row is not part of either card.

